&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Associate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Chief of Staff (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;CoS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;) to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;SVP Global Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a critical role that combines strategic leadership and operational excellence to be a trusted advisor and recognized leader on the team. The role is primarily responsible for tackling&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;SVP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Global Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;most important priorities through the orchestration of activities owned by various constituents across the entire organization. This is a highly visible and collaborative role that is instrumental&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;the success of the overall organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335557