&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Strategic Partnership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;: Act as a strategic advisor to&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;the SVP Global Engineering&lt;/span&gt;, helping to define, prioritize, and operationalize the&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;strategy. Partner closely with senior leadership across the organization to ensure alignment with business&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;and drive key&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;initiatives.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;: Oversee the operational rhythm of the&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;function, including managing the calendar, meeting agendas, and strategic planning processes. Drive&amp;nbsp;efficiencies&amp;nbsp;and process improvements within&amp;nbsp;Global Engineering.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
