&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Communication and Alignment&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Partner with the GPTO’s Corporate&amp;nbsp;communications&amp;nbsp;business partner to manage and&amp;nbsp;facilitate&amp;nbsp;communication and alignment across the&amp;nbsp;Engineering&amp;nbsp;leadership team. Prepare briefing materials, presentations, and reports for key meetings&amp;nbsp;and run the Engineering Town Halls.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/li&gt;
